{"5425850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Ale and Bounty: Idle RPG","steam_appid":5425850,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5425850\/extras\/c63c2b96af1d78b6294dcb94f6814f93.avif?t=1793740747\" width=920 height=214 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From one lantern to a legendary frontier town<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironspur is dust, a fence post and a patch of land that is still yours. Take a bounty on the Dustroad, spend the reward on your first saloon, and watch the town grow around it. Guests arrive, coins roll in, and your gunslingers keep fighting long after you stop clicking.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An idle RPG you can play your way<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your party fights on its own.<\/strong> Level up the Marshal, Brother Brass and Pip Powder, push through stages and take down a boss every ten. Every ten levels doubles a hero’s damage.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your taverns earn for you.<\/strong> Each building runs its own business. Buy levels, hit milestones, hire managers who reinvest automatically.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the wheel when you want.<\/strong> Jump into a bounty yourself with auto-fire, dodge, lasso and Deadeye. Break the Toll Knight’s charge with a well-timed lasso.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend what you build.<\/strong> Fame draws raiders. Hold the street while your guests run for cover.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come back to a reward.<\/strong> The frontier keeps working while the game is closed, up to eight hours, and a report shows what you earned.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5425850\/extras\/2dc5052e60616bad0e532159553eea0b.avif?t=1793740747\" width=920 height=214 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a town that feels alive<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from empty land and grow, building by building, from a homestead to a frontier town.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch visitors walk to your doors, drink inside and leave coins behind.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a meal and a drink before every ride for a real edge in combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name your Marshal and your town and keep up to three frontiers in separate save slots.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A hand-made look<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxel characters and buildings modeled in Blender, a printed-paper interface drawn in ink and ochre, and a warm sunset palette. The game is built to look good on a stream and to be easy to read at a glance, with large, clean numbers that climb as your frontier grows.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5425850\/extras\/c63c2b96af1d78b6294dcb94f6814f93.avif?t=1793740747\" width=920 height=214 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From one lantern to a legendary frontier town<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironspur is dust, a fence post and a patch of land that is still yours. Take a bounty on the Dustroad, spend the reward on your first saloon, and watch the town grow around it. Guests arrive, coins roll in, and your gunslingers keep fighting long after you stop clicking.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An idle RPG you can play your way<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your party fights on its own.<\/strong> Level up the Marshal, Brother Brass and Pip Powder, push through stages and take down a boss every ten. Every ten levels doubles a hero’s damage.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your taverns earn for you.<\/strong> Each building runs its own business. Buy levels, hit milestones, hire managers who reinvest automatically.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the wheel when you want.<\/strong> Jump into a bounty yourself with auto-fire, dodge, lasso and Deadeye. Break the Toll Knight’s charge with a well-timed lasso.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend what you build.<\/strong> Fame draws raiders. Hold the street while your guests run for cover.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come back to a reward.<\/strong> The frontier keeps working while the game is closed, up to eight hours, and a report shows what you earned.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5425850\/extras\/2dc5052e60616bad0e532159553eea0b.avif?t=1793740747\" width=920 height=214 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a town that feels alive<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from empty land and grow, building by building, from a homestead to a frontier town.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch visitors walk to your doors, drink inside and leave coins behind.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a meal and a drink before every ride for a real edge in combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name your Marshal and your town and keep up to three frontiers in separate save slots.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A hand-made look<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voxel characters and buildings modeled in Blender, a printed-paper interface drawn in ink and ochre, and a warm sunset palette. The game is built to look good on a stream and to be easy to read at a glance, with large, clean numbers that climb as your frontier grows.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2>","short_description":"Build a frontier saloon from empty land into a booming town. Hire gunslingers who battle on their own, run taverns that earn while you’re away, and step in to fight bounties and bosses yourself. A voxel western idle RPG.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5425850\/fb3df30e97d6127122870ec280ac93e11c2b360a\/header.jpg?t=1793740747","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5425850\/a8d97f302a82bbedbd7f8cab72c2240e3341589c\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793740747","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5425850\/a8d97f302a82bbedbd7f8cab72c2240e3341589c\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793740747","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 700 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 700 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"All rights belong to A. Kaunitz and eXtreme Soul Studio","developers":["KineticFox","eXtreme Soul"],"publis